# PHASE 7 — Runtime API / Application Entry Point

Replace the current minimal `/healthz`-only application stub with a proper application runtime entry point while keeping the existing health endpoint working.

Create a clean application layer capable of:

```text
start()
handleRequest()
shutdown()
```

